# Every distro version OBS builds demoreel for
# (docs/specs/DEMO-0068-linux-packages.md § 4.7). obs-setup.sh makes the OBS
# project's repositories from this file, and ./ci.sh --obs-check tests each.
#
# Six fields: the OBS repository name, the <project>/<repository> it builds
# against, the container image --obs-check tests it in, its package manager,
# and what `demoreel check` must do there: its exit status, then text its
# output must contain, which runs to the end of the line.
